{"format":"kards-original-reference","version":1,"id":"ae9e4ec18d525dbd","name":"card_unit_iron_division","package":"/Game/Blueprints/Cards/Poland/units/card_unit_iron_division","parent":"UBaseCardObject","card":{"title":"IRON DIVISION","text":"At the start of your turn, draw a card. Destroy this unit after the third time.","flavorText":"The 1st Legions Infantry Division was formed in 1919 and saw extensive action during the Polish-Soviet War (1919–1921). During the German invasion of Poland in September 1939, the division, commanded by Col. Wincenty Kowalski, was deployed as part of the Modlin Army near the border with East Prussia. Fully mobilized after the invasion began, the division first engaged German troops on 4 September 1939 near Długosiodło. It successfully repelled a German assault near Brańszczyk, conducting delaying actions while retreating toward Kałuszyn. On 11 September, German forces captured the town, but the division recaptured it after intense night fighting. On 13 September, the division launched a counterattack in the Battle of Kałuszyn, breaking through multiple German defensive lines but suffering heavy casualties, losing most of its artillery and supplies. The remaining scattered troops regrouped, with the largest contingent under Gen. Kowalski, now reduced to only three infantry companies. They later joined Polish forces under Gen. Stefan Dąb-Biernacki and took part in the Battle of Falków on 22 September, securing a victory against the German 8th Infantry Division. Soon after, the division ceased to exist as a combat force. Despite its losses, it distinguished itself during the invasion of Poland and was regarded by Wehrmacht soldiers as the \"Iron Division\".","faction":"Poland","type":"infantry","rarity":"Uncommon","cost":5,"operationCost":1,"attack":6,"defense":6},"defaults":{"UberGraphFrame":{},"Name":"card_unit_iron_division","title":{"Namespace":"card_poland","Key":"card_unit_iron_division_title","SourceString":"IRON DIVISION","LocalizedString":"IRON DIVISION"},"Type":"ETypeEnum::infantry","attack":6,"defense":6,"range":1,"faction":"EFactionEnum::Poland","kredits":5,"Text":{"Namespace":"card_poland","Key":"card_unit_iron_division_text","SourceString":"At the start of your turn, draw a card. Destroy this unit after the third time.","LocalizedString":"At the start of your turn, draw a card. Destroy this unit after the third time."},"flavorText":{"Namespace":"card_poland","Key":"card_unit_iron_division_history","SourceString":"The 1st Legions Infantry Division was formed in 1919 and saw extensive action during the Polish-Soviet War (1919–1921). During the German invasion of Poland in September 1939, the division, commanded by Col. Wincenty Kowalski, was deployed as part of the Modlin Army near the border with East Prussia. Fully mobilized after the invasion began, the division first engaged German troops on 4 September 1939 near Długosiodło. It successfully repelled a German assault near Brańszczyk, conducting delaying actions while retreating toward Kałuszyn. On 11 September, German forces captured the town, but the division recaptured it after intense night fighting. On 13 September, the division launched a counterattack in the Battle of Kałuszyn, breaking through multiple German defensive lines but suffering heavy casualties, losing most of its artillery and supplies. The remaining scattered troops regrouped, with the largest contingent under Gen. Kowalski, now reduced to only three infantry companies. They later joined Polish forces under Gen. Stefan Dąb-Biernacki and took part in the Battle of Falków on 22 September, securing a victory against the German 8th Infantry Division. Soon after, the division ceased to exist as a combat force. Despite its losses, it distinguished itself during the invasion of Poland and was regarded by Wehrmacht soldiers as the \"Iron Division\".","LocalizedString":"The 1st Legions Infantry Division was formed in 1919 and saw extensive action during the Polish-Soviet War (1919–1921). During the German invasion of Poland in September 1939, the division, commanded by Col. Wincenty Kowalski, was deployed as part of the Modlin Army near the border with East Prussia. Fully mobilized after the invasion began, the division first engaged German troops on 4 September 1939 near Długosiodło. It successfully repelled a German assault near Brańszczyk, conducting delaying actions while retreating toward Kałuszyn. On 11 September, German forces captured the town, but the division recaptured it after intense night fighting. On 13 September, the division launched a counterattack in the Battle of Kałuszyn, breaking through multiple German defensive lines but suffering heavy casualties, losing most of its artillery and supplies. The remaining scattered troops regrouped, with the largest contingent under Gen. Kowalski, now reduced to only three infantry companies. They later joined Polish forces under Gen. Stefan Dąb-Biernacki and took part in the Battle of Falków on 22 September, securing a victory against the German 8th Infantry Division. Soon after, the division ceased to exist as a combat force. Despite its losses, it distinguished itself during the invasion of Poland and was regarded by Wehrmacht soldiers as the \"Iron Division\"."},"operationCost":1,"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Uncommon","cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::BloodAndIron","isInPermanentPool":true,"EffectType":"ECardEffectTypes::Trigger","usedTriggers":["ERegisteredCardFunction::OnStartofTurn"],"hasGuard":true,"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/Poland/Mini_Ally_Expansion_25/t_iron_division.t_iron_division","SubPathString":""},"artist":"Polish WWII Poster","historyPhoto":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/HistoricalPhotos/IRON_DIVISION.IRON_DIVISION","SubPathString":""},"historyPhotoSize":{"X":512.0,"Y":344.0},"historyPhotoDescription":{"Namespace":"card_poland","Key":"card_unit_iron_division_photo","SourceString":"Men of the 1st Legions Infantry Division (Iron Division) parading. Date unknown.","LocalizedString":"Men of the 1st Legions Infantry Division (Iron Division) parading. Date unknown."},"blowUpExplosionNiagara":{"ObjectName":"NiagaraSystem'NS_ExplosionInfantryM'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Effects/Niagara/NS_ExplosionInfantryM.46"},"blowUpCameraShake":{"ObjectName":"BlueprintGeneratedClass'CameraShakeMedium_C'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/examples/GrenadePack/Blueprints/CameraShakeMedium.0"},"OnAttackVisualsSoft":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Blueprints/Effects/Infantry/BP_AttackInfantry.BP_AttackInfantry_C","SubPathString":""}},"variables":[],"functions":[{"name":"ExecuteUbergraph_card_unit_iron_division","owner":"card_unit_iron_division_C","params":[{"name":"EntryPoint","type":"int32","direction":"in"}],"pure":false,"event":false,"flags":"FUNC_Final | FUNC_UbergraphFunction | FUNC_HasDefaults","locals":[{"name":"K2Node_Event_turnnumber","type":"int32","direction":"in"},{"name":"CallFunc_IsLocatedOnBoard_isIt","type":"bool","direction":"in"},{"name":"CallFunc_DrawCardsFromDeckBySide_cardsIDs","type":"TArray<int32>","direction":"in"},{"name":"CallFunc_JSON_GetInt_value","type":"int32","direction":"in"},{"name":"CallFunc_JSON_GetInt_found","type":"bool","direction":"in"},{"name":"CallFunc_Add_IntInt_ReturnValue","type":"int32","direction":"in"},{"name":"CallFunc_JSON_GetInt_value_1","type":"int32","direction":"in"},{"name":"CallFunc_JSON_GetInt_found_1","type":"bool","direction":"in"},{"name":"CallFunc_Conv_IntToText_ReturnValue","type":"FText","direction":"in"},{"name":"CallFunc_Greater_IntInt_ReturnValue","type":"bool","direction":"in"},{"name":"CallFunc_JSON_SetInt_found","type":"bool","direction":"in"},{"name":"CallFunc_AddNumberToText_qqq","type":"int32","direction":"in"},{"name":"CallFunc_IsSideActive_active","type":"bool","direction":"in"},{"name":"CallFunc_BooleanAND_ReturnValue","type":"bool","direction":"in"},{"name":"CallFunc_JSON_Clear_found","type":"bool","direction":"in"}],"body":[{"op":"ComputedJump","at":0,"valu